  "gameData": {
    "backstory": "Hatch, as he's now begrudgingly known, spent his early days trying to prove his mom wrong about everything. She told him the old ways were dead, that DRIP was everything. He ran away from the brood, scribbled hazard markings on his down, and swore he'd find a better way in the ruins of Subchain City.",
