    "personality": "Rebellious: Hatch constantly questions authority and established norms, often leading him into trouble. Resourceful: He's adept at scavenging and repurposing discarded tech, turning junk into useful tools. Brooding: Despite his rebelliousness, Hatch is haunted by doubts and a deep-seated fear of failure.",
